'''Faction Quests''' are quests that can be completed daily to gain {{Reputation}}.

== Mechanics ==
If the player is part of the {{Red|Barbarian}} or {{Purple|Mage}} [[Faction]], they can complete up to 5 Faction Quests for their Faction daily. The list of quests is located on the town board in the Community Center of the player's Faction. Each quest can be viewed by clicking on its map icon on the town board. Once completed, a quest's rewards can be claimed from the town board.

A quest can be one of the following types:
*Fishing: Fishing up a certain [[Trophy Fish]]
*Fetch: Bringing certain materials to the town board
*Miniboss: Defeating a certain miniboss
*Rescue: Finding a trapped Hostage in the {{Zone|Cathedral}} (Barbarian) / {{Zone|The Bastion}} (Mage)
*Dojo: Completing a certain [[Dojo]] challenge with a certain minimum rank
*Kuudra: Defeating a certain tier of Kuudra

Each quest also has a tier, which determines its difficulty and rewards. The tier can be one of the following:
*{{White|Ⓓ}} {{Common}}
*{{Green|Ⓒ}} {{Uncommon}}
*{{Blue|Ⓑ}} {{Rare}}
*{{Purple|Ⓐ}} {{Epic}}
*{{Gold|Ⓢ}} {{Legendary}}

The item rewards from Fishing quests are rolled from a different loot pool.

